---
// Read requests as an event stream joined with state by the same partition key. Keys and events are illustrative.
// Plain inline SVG with site CSS tokens; polygon arrowheads avoid duplicate marker ids.
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
---
<figure class="unb-fig">
  <div class="unb-scroll">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 900 318" role="img" aria-label="A write stream and a read stream, both keyed by user 42, flow into one stream processor. It answers a one-off read with a single reply, keeps a subscription open for later writes, and logs the read for provenance.">
      <text x="20" y="26" class="unb-h"><tspan data-lang-en>Writes and reads meet in one stream processor</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Lệnh ghi và lệnh đọc gặp nhau ở một stream processor</tspan></text>
      <rect x="20" y="60" width="280" height="64" rx="4" class="unb-box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="log" x={45} y={92} size={26} />
      <text x="184" y="88" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-b"><tspan data-lang-en>Write stream</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Luồng ghi</tspan></text>
      <text x="184" y="105" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-m"><tspan data-lang-en>key = user 42: address changed</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>key = user 42: đổi địa chỉ</tspan></text>
      <rect x="20" y="170" width="280" height="64" rx="4" class="unb-box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="laptop" x={45} y={202} size={26} />
      <text x="184" y="198" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-b"><tspan data-lang-en>Read stream</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Luồng đọc</tspan></text>
      <text x="184" y="215" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-m"><tspan data-lang-en>key = user 42: read profile</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>key = user 42: đọc hồ sơ</tspan></text>
      <path d="M300,92 L335,92 L335,120 L353,120" class="unb-solid" /><polygon points="352,115.5 352,124.5 360,120" class="unb-head" />
      <path d="M300,202 L335,202 L335,170 L353,170" class="unb-solid" /><polygon points="352,165.5 352,174.5 360,170" class="unb-head" />
      <rect x="360" y="80" width="210" height="130" rx="4" class="unb-box is-good" />
      <DiagramIcon name="worker" x={465} y={108} size={28} />
      <text x="465" y="146" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-b"><tspan data-lang-en>Stream processor</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Stream processor</tspan></text>
      <text x="465" y="163" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-m"><tspan data-lang-en>partition for key user 42</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>partition cho key user 42</tspan></text>
      <text x="465" y="180" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-m"><tspan data-lang-en>joins reads with state</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>ghép lệnh đọc với state</tspan></text>
      <path d="M570,100 L605,100 L605,70 L633,70" class="unb-solid is-good" /><polygon points="632,65.5 632,74.5 640,70" class="unb-head is-good" />
      <path d="M570,146 L633,146" class="unb-solid is-good" /><polygon points="632,141.5 632,150.5 640,146" class="unb-head is-good" />
      <path d="M570,190 L605,190 L605,222 L633,222" class="unb-dashed" /><polygon points="632,217.5 632,226.5 640,222" class="unb-head" />
      <rect x="640" y="40" width="240" height="60" rx="4" class="unb-box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="mail" x={665} y={70} size={26} />
      <text x="784" y="66" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-b"><tspan data-lang-en>One-off read</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Đọc một lần</tspan></text>
      <text x="784" y="83" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-m"><tspan data-lang-en>one reply, then it is done</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>một phản hồi rồi xong</tspan></text>
      <rect x="640" y="116" width="240" height="60" rx="4" class="unb-box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="sync" x={665} y={146} size={26} />
      <text x="784" y="142" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-b"><tspan data-lang-en>Subscription</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Đăng ký theo dõi</tspan></text>
      <text x="784" y="159" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-m"><tspan data-lang-en>reply on every new write</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>trả lời mỗi lần có ghi mới</tspan></text>
      <rect x="640" y="192" width="240" height="60" rx="4" class="unb-box is-dash" />
      <DiagramIcon name="eye" x={665} y={222} size={26} />
      <text x="784" y="218" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-b"><tspan data-lang-en>Logged read</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Lệnh đọc được ghi lại</tspan></text>
      <text x="784" y="235" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-m"><tspan data-lang-en>what the shopper saw</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>thứ người mua đã thấy</tspan></text>
      <text x="20" y="286" text-anchor="start" class="unb-note"><tspan data-lang-en>Both streams use the same key, so one machine sees the write and the read in order.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Cả hai luồng dùng chung key, nên một máy thấy lệnh ghi và lệnh đọc theo đúng thứ tự.</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>A GET is a short-lived join; a subscription is a join that never closes. Logging the read keeps a record of what the user saw.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Một lệnh GET là phép join ngắn hạn; một subscription là phép join không bao giờ đóng. Ghi lại lệnh đọc giữ được bằng chứng người dùng đã thấy gì.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .unb-fig { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .unb-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .unb-fig svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .unb-fig text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .unb-fig .unb-h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .unb-fig .unb-lane-h { font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .unb-fig .unb-lane-sub { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .unb-fig .unb-in-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 13.5px; }
  .unb-fig .unb-in-m { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .unb-fig .unb-note { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .unb-fig .unb-note.is-hot { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .unb-fig .unb-note.is-good { fill: var(--gold-icon); font-weight: 700; }
  .unb-fig .unb-mono { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; }
  .unb-fig .unb-tick { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .unb-panel { fill: none; stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .unb-panel.is-fill { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .unb-panel.is-hot { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .unb-panel.is-good { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .unb-box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .unb-box.is-hot { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .unb-box.is-good { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .unb-box.is-dash { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; fill: none; }
  .unb-box.is-dash.is-good { fill: none; }
  .unb-box.is-dash.is-hot { fill: none; }
  .unb-solid { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .unb-solid.is-hot { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; }
  .unb-solid.is-good { stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 2; }
  .unb-solid.is-dashedline { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .unb-dashed { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .unb-dashed.is-hot { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .unb-dashed.is-good { stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .unb-head { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .unb-head.is-hot { fill: var(--red); }
  .unb-head.is-good { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .unb-step { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .unb-step.is-hot { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); }
  .unb-step.is-good { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); }
  .unb-fig .unb-step-n { font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .unb-fig figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
